<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1721456397"/></metadata></head><body dur="2:55.529"><div begin="31.092" end="41.122" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="31.092" end="33.375" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.092" end="32.257">我的幻术是超能</span><span begin="32.257" end="32.540">力</span> <span begin="32.600" end="33.220">我天生神</span><span begin="33.220" end="33.375">力</span></p><p begin="33.673" end="35.975" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.673" end="34.828">你的魔术要靠道</span><span begin="34.828" end="35.078">具</span> <span begin="35.141" end="35.790">还真不给</span><span begin="35.790" end="35.975">力</span></p><p begin="36.123" end="38.638" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.123" end="37.160">你话术耍耍嘴皮</span> <span begin="37.160" end="37.806">声东击西</span> <span begin="37.806" end="38.371">分散注</span><span begin="38.371" end="38.638">意</span></p><p begin="38.725" end="41.122" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.725" end="39.373">我根本不理</span> <span begin="39.373" end="40.121">省点力气</span> <span begin="40.121" end="40.903">你还真有耐</span><span begin="40.903" end="41.122">性</span></p></div><div begin="41.393" end="51.696" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="41.393" end="44.228" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.393" end="41.723">啊</span> <span begin="41.723" end="42.018">玩</span><span begin="42.018" end="42.370">ㄧ玩</span><span begin="42.370" end="42.922">纸牌</span> <span begin="42.922" end="43.271">消</span><span begin="43.271" end="43.642">失了</span><span begin="43.642" end="44.228">钱币</span></p><p begin="44.234" end="46.773" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.234" end="46.225">手里变出白鸽都是小朋友的</span><span begin="46.225" end="46.773">把戏</span></p><p begin="46.775" end="48.853" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.775" end="47.069">猜</span><span begin="47.069" end="48.853">你应该使用了障眼的把戏</span></p><p begin="49.024" end="51.696" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.024" end="49.473">不然你</span><span begin="49.473" end="50.425">看一看你旁边的观众</span> <span begin="50.425" end="50.754">他们都</span><span begin="50.754" end="50.973">跑</span><span begin="50.973" end="51.245">到哪</span><span begin="51.245" end="51.696">去</span></p></div><div begin="52.674" end="1:02.470" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="52.674" end="54.928" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.674" end="53.225">出神入</span><span begin="53.225" end="53.670">化</span> <span begin="54.018" end="54.521">雾里看</span><span begin="54.521" end="54.928">花</span></p><p begin="55.271" end="57.621" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.271" end="56.571">跟我拼命你会输掉</span><span begin="56.571" end="56.788">所</span><span begin="56.788" end="56.928">有</span><span begin="56.928" end="57.093">筹</span><span begin="57.093" end="57.621">码</span></p><p begin="57.804" end="1:00.167" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.804" end="58.379">出神入</span><span begin="58.379" end="58.874">化</span> <span begin="59.123" end="59.648">浪迹天</span><span begin="59.648" end="1:00.167">涯</span></p><p begin="1:00.407" end="1:02.470" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.407" end="1:01.074">认真起来</span><span begin="1:01.074" end="1:01.608">我连我自己</span><span begin="1:01.608" end="1:01.719">都</span><span begin="1:01.719" end="1:02.041">害</span><span begin="1:02.041" end="1:02.470">怕</span></p></div><div begin="1:02.719" end="1:12.320" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:02.719" end="1:04.628" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.719" end="1:02.827">Now</span> <span begin="1:02.827" end="1:02.927">you</span> <span begin="1:02.927" end="1:03.371">see</span> <span begin="1:03.371" end="1:03.650">me,</span> <span begin="1:03.650" end="1:03.873">'cause</span> <span begin="1:03.873" end="1:03.973">I</span> <span begin="1:03.973" end="1:04.193">let</span> <span begin="1:04.193" end="1:04.312">it</span> <span begin="1:04.312" end="1:04.628">be</span></p><p begin="1:04.836" end="1:06.928" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1">